  "OnInterceptorSequenceFinished": "Detecting increased heart rate and adrenaline concentration. In order to foster a positive, healthy attitude,<duration=7245>\nconsider taking a moment to reflect first on your emotions, and then on your actions.<delay=7238><duration=5830>",
