  "ProtoCalibrationCodeEncy_Title": "Transmission Calibration Code",
  "ProtoCalibrationCodeEncy_Body": "A local alien broadcast has outlined a six-point pattern matching the movements of the Prototype during the prior exercise.\n\nThe pattern appears to represent a highly precise set of instructions to assist in the transmission of data type: [NEURAL CLUSTER]. While it is unknown why such data may require transmitting, it may lead to further acquisition of valuable alien data.\n\n<b>Assessment: Continue following alien instructions to retrieve advanced technologies. Mutual profit will follow.</b>",
  
